  "body": "We resolved in https://github.com/w3c/svgwg/issues/315 to change definition of all but href (which has wide usage) to the same definition as HTML.\r\n\r\nTherefor we should remove from SVG and define a new mixin in HTML. I'm not sure if this should be a entirely new mixin or if we should reuse the existing one for those that are common with the `area` element?\r\n\r\nOnce this is resolved I'll do a PR to add it to the SVG spec and link to WHATWG HTML.",
